# needs responsive-tabs.scm, run with TEXMACS_VUE_TAB_MODE=side, mobile or
# grid. side: the second tab chosen in the column shows its page, then the
# first; mobile:
# the list, the second row opens its page under a Back button, Back
# returns to the list; grid: the three pages at once (the clicks fall on
# pages and change nothing)
wait 8000
window Vue tabs
snapshot t0
click 40 35
wait 500
snapshot t1
click 30 10
wait 500
snapshot t2
wait 500
